+3.  For each level $j$, iterate through indices $i$ from $0$ to $2^j - 1$ (inclusive).
+4.  Initialize a flag `insert` to 0.
+5.  For $k$ from $0$ to $1$:
+    a. Compute the detail coefficient $d_{j, 2i+k}$ using the formulas above.
